## CRITICAL: MIA Attacker Methodology
Bug found 2026-02-08: eval scripts loaded pre-trained attackers (F vs RETAIN=28k).
Fixed in all 6 scripts. Canonical approach: train FRESH attacker on F vs matched neg
from BASELINE model. 70 dims, spectral norm, [256,256], dropout 0.3.

