### Paper review assessment (my analysis):
- NeurIPS: 25-35% acceptance chance
- TMLR: 55-65%
- Workshop: 80%+
- Main gaps: single domain (scRNA only), negative results without solution, narrow theory
- Improvements suggested: test non-biological VAE, add recent methods, constructive result

### Advantage metric decision: KEEP
- Correctly handles Streisand effect (AUC=0.153), high-variance methods (extra-gradient)
- Cited to Yeom 2018, both AUC+advantage in every table
- Cost to revert would be massive with high error risk
